ontents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n2le03ob05re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "id": 12}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n2le03ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n2le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<p><br /><strong>Lecturer</strong>: Good morning, everybody. Today, we are going to continue talking about HTML editors. Let&rsquo;s start by having a round of questions to solve general doubts. Who would like to start? <br /><strong>Sara</strong>: Me, sir. Can a website be made with a free online editor? <br /><strong>Lecturer</strong>: Yes, there are many free online HTLM editors that offer different interactive features for website developers. <br /><strong>Sara</strong>:&nbsp; What kind of features can be found in those editors?"}, {"time": "28000", "image": "enpe8n2le03ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<br /><strong>Lecturer</strong>: Well, most of the free online editors offer the same features as paid versions, except for the variety of color scheme or uploading options. There are many services such as syntax highlighting, indentation, HTML cleaning and file conversion. <br /><strong>Sara</strong>: Does HTML cleaning refer to source cleaning options? <br /><strong>Lecturer</strong>: Absolutely, there is generally an option in which invalided code can be fixed. <br /><strong>Sara</strong>: What online editor do you recommend? <br /><strong>Lecturer</strong>: There&rsquo;s a demo I usually suggest to my students; it is html-online.com. It offers a lot of functional features that you can use online. The only failing in this editor is the absence of a Lorem-Ipsum generator."}, {"time": "78000", "image": "enpe8n2le03ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<br /><strong>Sara</strong>: Can this editor be downloaded? <br /><strong>Lecturer</strong>:&nbsp; There&rsquo;s no need, you can work on it in any internet browser. What I recommend is to experiment with the editor&rsquo;s features before start working on website content. <br /><strong>Sara</strong>: How do we have to use it normally? <br /><strong>Lecturer</strong>: Well, once you open the page, you can find two editors together. First, there is a visual editor where you can see the website content; on the right side of the screen, there is a source editor where the HTLM source code appears. Then, above the HTLM editor, there are some basic commands on the control panel you can use to adjust font size, delete data with the undone button, pick colors or start a new document.</p>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n2le03ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}